BEGINCFG ... ENDCFG        - add sensor config (multi-line)
BEGINCFG|k=v|...|ENDCFG    - add sensor config (inline with '|', supports \|)
BEGINRULE ... ENDRULE      - add rule (multi-line)
BEGINRULE|k=v|...|ENDRULE  - add rule (inline with '|', supports \|)
RUN / STOP                 - control sampling
TRIGGER <sensor|source>     - arm one-shot/event-driven sensor(s)
PAIR <A> <B> <A|B> <guard_us> - one stopped-mode sonar pair diagnostic (50 ms)
WINDOW <A> <B> <radar> <guard_us> <A_mm> <B_mm> <xmin> <xmax> <ymin> <ymax>
CLEAR                      - clear sensors + rules
SHOW / SHOWRULES           - show sensors / rules
CLEARRULES                 - clear only rules
HELP                       - this text
Example inline rule (HMC5883L big-endian X,Z,Y at 0x03):
BEGINRULE|name=GY511_MAG|source=GY511_ACC|calc=mx=s16be(0)|calc=mz=s16be(2)|calc=my=s16be(4)|calc=mag=sqrt(mx*mx+my*my+mz*mz)|when=mag>350|action=log:MAG change detected|ENDRULE
STOP
